Rāma soothes enraged Lakṣmaṇa --- Rāma vouches for Bharata's goodwill --- Rāma promises Lakṣmaṇa the kingdom through Bharata --- Rāma hopes Bharata comes to lead them home --- Ashamed Lakṣmaṇa descends from the tree --- Rāma spots steeds and elephant Śatruñjaya --- Bharata orders a spacious camp --- Bharata's righteous army shines seeking Rāma's favor